<title>EGYPT: French European minister in Cairo for talks.</title>
<headline>French European minister in Cairo for talks.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Minister Delegate for European Affairs Michel Barnier arrived in Cairo on Sunday for talks with Egyptian officials expected to cover Egypt's relations with the European Union.</p>
<p>Barnier is due to meet Foreign Minister Amr Moussa and Supply and Trade Minister Ahmed Gueily, Egyptian officials said.</p>
<p>The French minister is set to leave Egypt later on Sunday.</p>
</text>
